    {
      "id": "claim_d512433d8b114757b964025df55ab19f",
      "statement": "scripts/ci.sh is the provider-agnostic single source of truth for renderer CI, running from the repo root under set -euo pipefail in order: install (npm ci or npm install, skippable via SKIP_INSTALL=1), typecheck (npm run typecheck), wiki-link check (npm run check:wiki), project site link check (npm run check:site), unit tests with coverage (npm run test:coverage), integration tests (npm run test:integration), the static SPA build (npm run build), and a guard that fails when dist/ contains the demo data.",
